  "name": "Baked Cranberry Oatmeal",
  "subtitle": "Warm spiced oats with apples, cranberries, and walnuts",
  "description": "A comforting baked oatmeal combining fruit, warming spices, and chopped walnuts in a lightly sweetened milk mixture.",
